{"text": "Social media becomes more meaningful and effective when the firm uses it to collaborate with clients to develop new products or services as this collaboration or co creation helps create value for both firm and clients. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Clients become part of the creation and delivery of products and services, and therefore become more invested in the firm and its performance outcomes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Social media can effectively assist in client co creation by enabling clients to build better connections with firms because they can communicate their thoughts, ideas, hopes, needs, and desires to firms more easily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They can interact with other users of the firms products or services and share ideas with them, they can experience a sense of community with these other users, identify with them, and eventually develop closer relationships with the firm and its products and services. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Social media thus creates value both for clients and firms by facilitating co creation and enabling engagement.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "c", "i", "a", "l", " ", "m", "e", "d", "i", "a", " ", "b", "e", "c", "o", "m", "e", "s", " ", "m", "o", "r", "e", " ", "m", "e", "a", "n", "i", "n", "g", "f", "u", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "f", "f", "e", "c", "t", "i", "v", "e", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "m", " ", "u", "s", "e", "s", " ", "i", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "c", "o", "l", "l", "a", "b", "o", "r", "a", "t", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "c", "l", "i", "e", "n", "t", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "d", "e", "v", "e", "l", "o", "p", " ", "n", "e", "w", " ", "p", "r", "o", "d", "u", "c", "t", "s", " ", "o", "r", " ", "s", "e", "r", "v", "i", "c", "e", "s", " ", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "o", "l", "l", "a", "b", "o", "r", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "o", "r", " ", "c", "o", " ", "c", "r", "e", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "h", "e", "l", "p", "s